`websearch_to_tsquery` handles natural multi-word input ("blue running shoes") without you writing a query parser. Weighting `name` above `description` (`'A'` vs `'B'`) is the other real decision — it's what makes a name match outrank a description match, and it's cheap to retune later since it's just the generated-column expression.

